Now, my feature extractor will extract 3 tpyes of feature. 

1, I extract the features from the third convolutional layer of the fifth block
and considering the output of this is a tensor, so I also did the global average pooling and output will be a 512 d vector. 

and the other layer I chose is the FC 7.

the reason that I chose these 2 layers is The fc7 layer provides a compact, high-level semantic embedding.
while conv5_3 preserves richer spatial information that maybe more important for subtle facial expression. 

